  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/md78MGbEfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p>\n<h1>Create：錢幣學</h1>\n<p>《錢幣學》是一款全新的貨幣模組，提供易於使用的系統來搭建簡易商店，同時為你最瘋狂的紅石資本主義夢想留下發揮空間。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/creative_vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>商人</h3>\n<p>快速買賣物品，專為緊湊的玩家經營商店設計。</p>\n<p>創意模式版本允許伺服器管理員設定無限補充的商店。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bank_terminal.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>銀行終端機</h3>\n<p>存取你的虛擬銀行帳戶，進行硬幣的存款與提領。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/andesite_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/brass_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>存款機</h3>\n<p>設定價格後，當玩家將金錢存入（透過背包中的硬幣或使用卡片），存款機將發出一個紅石刻脈衝。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>硬幣</h3>\n<p>本模組的核心，提供 6 種不同價值的硬幣可供選擇。</p>\n<table style=\"width:70.5514%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">齒刺</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">斜齒</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">鏈輪</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">齒輪</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">皇冠</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.3823%\">太陽</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">1 齒刺</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 齒刺</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">16 齒刺</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">64 齒刺</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 齒輪</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%;text-align:center\">64 齒輪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/spur.png\" alt=\"Spur\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bevel.png\" alt=\"Bevel\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sprocket.png\" alt=\"Sprocket\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/cog.png\" alt=\"Cog\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/crown.png\" alt=\"Crown\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sun.png\" alt=\"Sun\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_id_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>銀行卡與身份證</h3>\n<p>銀行卡可放置於存款機或商人中，讓資金直接存入關聯的帳戶。此外，在商人或存款機上使用銀行卡會從你的帳戶扣款，而非從背包取出硬幣。</p>\n<p>身份證用於允許其他玩家存取錢幣學模組的受保護方塊（商人、存款機與烈焰銀行家），方便你輕鬆授予商業夥伴使用權限。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/blaze_banker.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>烈焰銀行家</h3>\n<p>一個銀行帳戶不夠滿足你的 <del>逃稅</del> 商業需求嗎？建立另一個帳戶，並使用身份證讓商業夥伴提領資金。</p>",
